'''Like a Record, Baby''' (ぐるぐる大回転, ''Guruguru Daikaiten'', '''Big Spin Round and Round''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (M): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 50%.

==Combo==
